# =====================================================================
# Simulating-Resources -- thesis Chapter 3 ("Simulating resources")
#
# WHITELIST. Everything in this folder is ignored by default and only the
# files the chapter actually uses are re-included below. A new file will
# therefore never be published by accident: to publish one, add a
# `!/filename` line here on purpose.
#
# Deliberately excluded (kept locally, never pushed): development notes
# (CHANGES_v*.md, README_dev_v3.md), the withdrawn Julia layer (*.jl,
# Project.toml, gloser_data_v2.csv), superseded variant runs
# (slade_moment / slade_bp / slade_bpamp / ho2005 / v4theta / state_*),
# archive folders (pre_*/, post_corr/, stale/, v4theta_dy0/), the recovery
# test, helper scripts not behind any reported result, figures not in the
# chapter (fit_v2*, convergence*), the chapter .tex/.bib sources (they live
# in the thesis repository), the publisher PDF of Gambaro et al. (2025),
# logs, backups and macOS files.
# =====================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything at the top level ...
/*

# 2. ... then re-include what the chapter uses.

# Repository files
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Makefile

# R environment (renv): lock file and bootstrap only, never the library
!/.Rprofile
!/renv.lock
!/renv/
/renv/*
!/renv/.gitignore
!/renv/activate.R
!/renv/settings.json

# Model, data and estimation code behind the chapter
!/run_all.R
!/model_v2.R
!/gloser_data_v2.R
!/residual_qq.R
!/tau_sweep.R
!/model_v1demand.R

# Published model: code of Gambaro et al. (2025), Resources Policy 103, 105548
!/model_v1.R

# Reported fit (configuration slade_cycle_drop_core): state, estimates, manifests
!/state_multistart__slade_cycle_drop_core.rds
!/multistart__slade_cycle_drop_core.csv
!/state_fit__slade_cycle_drop_core.rds
!/state_profile__slade_cycle_drop_core.rds
!/state_profile_best__slade_cycle_drop_core.rds
!/state_profile_subthreshold__slade_cycle_drop_core.rds
!/params_full__slade_cycle_drop_core.json
!/params_fitted__slade_cycle_drop_core.json
!/fitted_trajectory__slade_cycle_drop_core.csv
!/profile__slade_cycle_drop_core.csv
!/manifest_fit__slade_cycle_drop_core.txt
!/manifest_diag__slade_cycle_drop_core.txt
!/manifest_profile__slade_cycle_drop_core.txt
!/manifest_plot__slade_cycle_drop_core.txt

# Figures that appear in the chapter
!/profile__slade_cycle_drop_core.png
!/resid_qq__slade_cycle_drop_core.png
!/resid_vs_fitted__slade_cycle_drop_core.png
!/paper_stocks__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_flows__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_newflows__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_prices__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_supply__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_delay_prices__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_delay_supply__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_delay_flows__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf
!/paper_delay_stocks__slade_cycle_drop_core.pdf

# 3. Never publish, even if re-included by mistake above
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.bak*
*.log
